<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - June 30.</title>
<headline>Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - June 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>++++</p>
<p> STORM ALERT:     All Clear</p>
<p>				     ++++</p>
<p>METRO MANILA --  Partly cloudy with rainshower or thunderstorms,</p>
<p>			wind light to moderate southwesterly.</p>
<p>			Temp 24-33 C.</p>
<p> BAGUIO	 --  Cloudy with rainshowers. Winds light</p>
<p>			to moderate southwesterly. 15-20.</p>
<p> METRO CEBU   --  Cloudy with rainshowers or thunderstorms.</p>
<p>			Winds light to moderate southwesterly.</p>
<p>			25-33.</p>
<p>METRO DAVAO  --  Partly cloudy to cloudy with</p>
<p>			isolated rainshowers or thunderstorms.</p>
<p>			Winds light southwesterly. 24-32.</p>
<p>				     ++++</p>
</text>
